    <h1>Leonida Trophy Guide</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Every trophy, its official name and grade, a guide in our own words with its sources, and a tracker that remembers your progress — all offline.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="progress-card" id="progress-card">
    <p class="progress-count"><strong id="earned-count">0</strong> / 55 earned</p>
    <div class="progress-bar" role="progressbar" aria-label="Trophies earned" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="55" aria-valuenow="0" id="progress-bar"><span id="progress-fill"></span></div>
    <p class="progress-note" id="progress-note">Platinum: Vice Got a Price! — 54 to go.</p>
    <p class="progress-breakdown" id="progress-breakdown"></p>
  </div>
